# DRC-WS-RL-V: widespacing m1 10 20 m1 4 touching_ok (runlength 20); vertical parallel runs 25 and 15 (Q-DRC-7).
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/drctest -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load top
box 0 0 12 40
paint m1
box 14 0 16 25
paint m1
box 100 0 112 40
paint m1
box 114 0 116 15
paint m1
select top cell
box grow center 100
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc list count total
save top
